//                           the package's own, so the function could not be
//                           called that there)
//
// The error of 'inflate' and 'zlibDecompress' is deflate's DeflateError; its
// 'reason' and 'String() <- e' are what a DecodeError's are.

// Compress to a raw DEFLATE stream at 'level' (0 stored, 1 fixed Huffman and
// the fastest, 2 to 9 dynamic Huffman and smaller the higher; negative is 6)
pub extern fn deflate(data: &Array[u8], level: i32) List[u8];
